# ==============================================================================
# S3 & DynamoDB Remote State Backend Template
# ==============================================================================
# Step 1: Run Terraform in infra/terraform/bootstrap to provision the S3 bucket & DynamoDB table.
# Step 2: Copy this file to backend.tf:
#         cp backend.tf.example backend.tf
# Step 3: Populate bucket and dynamodb_table with outputs from the bootstrap step.
# Step 4: Run terraform init -migrate-state to migrate local state to AWS S3.
# ==============================================================================

